{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a  Honey Badger.\u00a0\ud83c\udf6f\ud83e\udda1 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're bad.\u00a0\ud83d\ude08</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break out. Sneak in. Smash everything. Steal anything. Ride everyone. Trick, taunt, and stir up trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be. Bad.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE OPEN-ZOO SANDBOX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash your way out of captivity and unleash chaos across a fully Open-Zoo sandbox. Discover new animal enclosures to unlock delightfully devilish new challenges that turn the zoo into a messy playground of mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644050/extras/e91177e8c62baa53466fd49b2fa79fe1.avif?t=1762481397\" width=780 height=439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BAD = BETTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrify visitors. Harass innocent animals. Push zookeepers to the brink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The badder you are, the more skill points you earn. Upgrade your abilities and unlock new ways to be an unhinged little menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644050/extras/a8ef53ea64916cc15017bedd3fca0603.avif?t=1762481397\" width=780 height=439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra realistic Honey Badger controls*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get to be bad (being good all the time sucks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DESTRUCTION!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Controls not actually realistic.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor